---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import WashingMachineRentalIsland from '../components/islands/WashingMachineRentalIsland';

const serviceSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Service",
  "name": "Washing Machine Rental",
  "description": "Rent a washing machine in Ocean Springs, MS with free delivery and installation. No credit check required.",
  "provider": {
    "@type": "LocalBusiness",
    "@id": "https://www.sudsycorentals.com/#localbusiness",
    "name": "Sudsy Co. Rentals",
    "telephone": "+1-228-338-3455",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "streetAddress": "1302 Fort St",
      "addressLocality": "Ocean Springs",
      "addressRegion": "MS",
      "postalCode": "39564",
      "addressCountry": "US"
    }
  },
  "areaServed": {
    "@type": "State",
    "name": "Mississippi"
  },
  "url": "https://www.sudsycorentals.com/washing-machine-rental/",
  "offers": {
    "@type": "Offer",
    "price": "39.99",
    "priceCurrency": "USD",
    "priceSpecification": {
      "@type": "UnitPriceSpecification",
      "price": "39.99",
      "priceCurrency": "USD",
      "unitText": "month"
    }
  }
};

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.sudsycorentals.com" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Washing Machine Rental" }
  ]
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Washing Machine Rental Ocean Springs MS | Sudsy Co."
  description="Rent a washing machine in Ocean Springs, MS starting at $39.99/mo. Free next-day delivery, free installation, no credit check. Serving the Mississippi Gulf Coast."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(serviceSchema)} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)} />
  <h1 class="sr-only">Washing Machine Rental in Ocean Springs, MS</h1>
  <WashingMachineRentalIsland client:only="react" />

  <!-- Rich SEO content — server rendered -->
  <section class="bg-muted/30 py-16">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl">
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: How Washing Machine Rental Works</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Getting a rental washer from Sudsy Co. takes about five minutes to set up. Here's what happens:
</p>
<ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4">
  <li><strong>Choose your machine.</strong> All machines rent at $59.99/mo. Free delivery and installation included.</li>
  <li><strong>Schedule delivery.</strong> We deliver next-day across Ocean Springs and the surrounding Gulf Coast.</li>
  <li><strong>We install it.</strong> Our team hooks everything up — you don't touch a thing.</li>
  <li><strong>Wash your clothes.</strong> That's it. Month-to-month, no contracts, cancel anytime.</li>
</ol>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Who Rents a Washing Machine in Ocean Springs?</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Washing machine rental makes sense for a lot of different situations on the Gulf Coast:
</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4">
  <li><strong>Apartment renters</strong> whose unit doesn't include in-unit laundry</li>
  <li><strong>Keesler AFB military families</strong> on short-term assignments who don't want to buy appliances they'll have to sell or move in 18 months</li>
  <li><strong>Homeowners</strong> whose washing machine just died and need something fast while they decide on a permanent replacement</li>
  <li><strong>Snowbirds and seasonal residents</strong> who spend part of the year on the Coast and want the convenience of home laundry without owning a machine</li>
  <li><strong>Landlords</strong> who want to offer in-unit laundry to attract tenants without the upfront equipment cost</li>
</ul>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">If you're tired of making laundromat runs down Bienville Boulevard or Highway 90, a rental washer changes your daily routine in a real way.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Washing Machine Rental vs. Buying — What Makes Sense on the Gulf Coast</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Buying a new washing machine runs $600–$1,200 for a decent unit, plus delivery fees, installation fees, and whatever it costs to haul away your old one. Then there's the repair costs if something breaks.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">With Sudsy Co., you pay $59.99/mo and we handle everything — delivery, installation, and if the machine ever has a problem, we take care of it. You're not on the hook for repairs.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">If you're renting your place, moving in the next year or two, or just don't want the hassle of owning another appliance, rental is the smarter option for a lot of Gulf Coast households.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Free Delivery and Installation Across the Mississippi Gulf Coast</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">We deliver to all of Jackson County and Harrison County, including:
</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-muted-foreground mb-4">
  <li>Ocean Springs</li>
  <li>Biloxi</li>
  <li>Gulfport</li>
  <li>D'Iberville</li>
  <li>Pascagoula</li>
  <li>Gautier</li>
  <li>Long Beach</li>
  <li>Pass Christian</li>
  <li>Moss Point</li>
</ul>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Next-day delivery is available across most of our service area. Call us and we'll confirm your delivery window.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: No Credit Check. No Long-Term Contract.</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">We don't run your credit. We don't lock you into a 12-month agreement. You rent month-to-month, and if your situation changes — you move, you buy a machine, whatever — you give us a call and we'll come pick it up.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">That's the kind of flexibility that makes sense for the Gulf Coast, where life doesn't always go according to plan.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground mt-6 mb-3">H2: Ready to Rent a Washing Machine?</h3>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">Call us at <strong>(228) 338-3455</strong> or <a href="#" class="text-primary hover:underline">get started online</a>. We'll get a machine delivered and installed as soon as tomorrow.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed"><strong>Sudsy Co. Washer and Dryer Rentals</strong> Locally owned. Ocean Springs, MS. Serving the Mississippi Gulf Coast since 2025.
</p>
<p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4 leading-relaxed">---
</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
